 \\\\u0026 Audio** — Apple Watch Series 12, Ultra 4, and AirPods 5 highlights\\\\n5. **Buying Guide** — Complete product-to-need table with key dates and pricing\\\\n\\\\nThe presentation uses the dark navy template with teal accent highlights throughout. This deck format does not carry speaker notes.\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\"},{\\\"extra_info\\\":{\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"STOP\\\"},\\\"payload\\\":{\\\"artifact_id\\\":\\\"1408630076875383\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Apple 2026 Product Lineup\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"slides\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"canvas\\\"}],\\\"conv_id\\\":\\\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\\\",\\\"msg_id\\\":\\\"1408630160679548\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1789187124869}\",\"id\":\"1408630160679548\",\"message_request_id\":\"5219fc328f963732502c4cda9d2d3e0e\",\"msg_type\":8,\"reply_to\":\"1408625986667107\",\"sender_id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"sender_user\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang's Migoo\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://migoo.ai/beeai/api/v1/media/download/2025/12/15/e9e12f4d.png\",\"user_type\":2,\"human\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980595\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKSTbh9Bga7HApyQcD8DUbuaYi9MMiPzTk5Rvyw2AhNhKwaoM=s96-c\",\"user_type\":1,\"relation\":1},\"relation\":0},\"seq\":1159,\"timestamp\":1789187123920},\"msg_id\":\"1408630160679548\",\"read_msg_seq\":0,\"reply_to\":\"1408625986667107\",\"timestamp\":1789187124887,\"title\":\"Agent\",\"type\":\"stream_end\"},\"server_stream_total_ms\":932},{\"msg_id\":\"1408630952927860\",\"conversation_id\":\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\",\"conversation_type\":\"2\",\"sender_id\":\"1312453424980595\",\"sender_user_type\":\"1\",\"sender_display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang\",\"sender_human_id\":\"\",\"reply_to\":\"\",\"timestamp\":\"1789187220657\",\"seq\":1160,\"finish_reason\":\"\",\"msg_type\":8,\"req_id\":\"76628ff70b6d3cac929ffe4157ad9557\",\"sent_at\":1789187220371,\"send_payloa