form\\\\\\\" connector bar** below the cards, visually linking all three products\\\\n\\\\n**Visual Emphasis:**\\\\n- iPhone Duo card is highlighted with a **teal (#9DDED9) border** and \\\\\\\"NEW\\\\\\\" badge to draw attention to the flagship foldable\\\\n- Each card has a **teal accent bar** at the top, with the Duo's bar being thicker (6px vs 4px) for emphasis\\\\n- Prices are enlarged to **64px** for immediate readability\\\\n- The insight banner uses a contrasting **#162050** background to stand out from the slide\\\\n\\\\n**Information Architecture:**\\\\n- Product specs are concise with **middle-dot separators** for easy scanning\\\\n- The bottom connector bar clearly communicates the shared A20 Pro · 3nm platform across all models\\\\n- Clean visual flow: title → ascending product cards → shared platform → key insight\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\"},\\\"block_index\\\":0,\\\"conv_id\\\":\\\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\\\",\\\"msg_id\\\":\\\"1408634483171953\\\",\\\"patch_type\\\":1,\\\"timestamp\\\":1789187651721,\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_chunk\\\"}\",\"id\":\"1408634483171953\",\"message_request_id\":\"76628ff70b6d3cac929ffe4157ad9557\",\"msg_type\":8,\"reply_to\":\"1408630952927860\",\"sender_id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"sender_user\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang's Migoo\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://migoo.ai/beeai/api/v1/media/download/2025/12/15/e9e12f4d.png\",\"user_type\":2,\"human\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980595\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKSTbh9Bga7HApyQcD8DUbuaYi9MMiPzTk5Rvyw2AhNhKwaoM=s96-c\",\"user_type\":1,\"relation\":1},\"relation\":0},\"seq\":1161,\"timestamp\":1789187651568},\"msg_id\":\"1408634483171953\",\"read_msg_seq\":0,\"reply_to\":\"1408630952927860\",\"timestamp\":1789187651741,\"title\":\"\",\"type\":\"stream_chunk\"}],\"chunk_count\":1,\"server_first_chunk_ms\":21,\"stream_end_at\":1789187652519,\"str