\\\\"Football Boys: A Story of Teamwork and Friendship\\\\\\\"\\\\n2. **The Spark** — Jack discovers a soccer ball in the park and falls in love with football\\\\n3. **New Friends** — Jack meets Sam, Leo, and Milo at the playground; together they form a team\\\\n4. **Practice Makes Better** — The boys train every afternoon, getting stronger day by day\\\\n5. **A Tough Day** — They lose their first big match, but lift each other up with encouragement\\\\n6. **The Big Match** — In the final game, teamwork leads to the winning goal\\\\n7. **Champions!** — The team lifts the golden trophy — but the real prize is their friendship\\\\n8. **The End** — A warm closing: \\\\\\\"Every great adventure starts with a ball, a friend, and the courage to try.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**Design:** Warm watercolor children's book illustrations with a vibrant gold-orange-green palette, comic-style speech balloons and sound effects, chapter markers on each page, and consistent page numbering. The layout alternates between left-text and right-text compositions for visual rhythm, with dark-framed cover and closing pages bookending the lighter story pages.\\\\n\\\\nThis deck format does not carry speaker notes.\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\"},\\\"block_index\\\":0,\\\"conv_id\\\":\\\"1408620129870461\\\",\\\"msg_id\\\":\\\"1408635096777336\\\",\\\"patch_type\\\":1,\\\"timestamp\\\":1789187726557,\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_chunk\\\"}\",\"id\":\"1408635096777336\",\"message_request_id\":\"e4362f5cb98d96cba81a96ca599ffca6\",\"msg_type\":8,\"reply_to\":\"1408630133621370\",\"sender_id\":\"1408620129624700\",\"sender_user\":{\"id\":\"1408620129624700\",\"display_name\":\"Picturebook Creator\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://cache-media-sg.migoo.ai/api/v4/50095895/beeai-budee-live-sg/agent/official-agent/picturebook-creator/2026-08-12/picturebook-creator.webp\",\"user_type\":4,\"relation\":1},\"seq\":5,\"timestamp\":1789187726472},\"msg_id\":\"1408635096777336\",\"read_msg_seq\":0,