splay_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang's Migoo\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://migoo.ai/beeai/api/v1/media/download/2025/12/15/e9e12f4d.png\",\"user_type\":2,\"human\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980595\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKSTbh9Bga7HApyQcD8DUbuaYi9MMiPzTk5Rvyw2AhNhKwaoM=s96-c\",\"user_type\":1,\"relation\":1},\"relation\":0},\"seq\":1166,\"timestamp\":1792579369011},\"msg_id\":\"1436419432325742\",\"read_msg_seq\":0,\"reply_to\":\"1436419367674493\",\"timestamp\":1792579374840,\"title\":\"\",\"type\":\"stream_chunk\"},{\"anchor\":\"1792579374964-0\",\"content\":\"\",\"conversation_type\":2,\"conversation_unread_count\":0,\"latest_msg_seq\":0,\"message\":{\"conversation_id\":\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\",\"customized_data\":\"{\\\"block\\\":{\\\"payload\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\" printer’s exact model number and country\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\"},\\\"block_index\\\":0,\\\"conv_id\\\":\\\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\\\",\\\"msg_id\\\":\\\"1436419432325742\\\",\\\"patch_type\\\":1,\\\"timestamp\\\":1792579374970,\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_chunk\\\"}\",\"id\":\"1436419432325742\",\"message_request_id\":\"f408233f36668d7dd648f61b21c17987\",\"msg_type\":8,\"reply_to\":\"1436419367674493\",\"sender_id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"sender_user\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang's Migoo\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://migoo.ai/beeai/api/v1/media/download/2025/12/15/e9e12f4d.png\",\"user_type\":2,\"human\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980595\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKSTbh9Bga7HApyQcD8DUbuaYi9MMiPzTk5Rvyw2AhNhKwaoM=s96-c\",\"user_type\":1,\"relation\":1},\"relation\":0},\"seq\":1166,\"timestamp\":1792579369011},\"msg_id\":\"1436419432325742\",\"read_msg_seq\":0,\"reply_to\":\"1436419367674493\",\"timestamp\":1792579375052,\"title\":\"\",\"type\":\"stream_chunk\"},{\"anchor\":\"1792579375066-0\",\"content\":\"\",\"conversation_type\":2,\"conversation_unread_count\":0,\"latest_msg_seq\":0,\"message\":{\"conversation_id\":\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\",\"customized_data\":\"{\\\"block\\\":{\\\"payload\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\", I can identify the correct cartridge code.\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\"},\\\"block_index\\\":0,\\\"conv_id\\\":\\\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\\\",\\\"msg_id\\\":\\\"1436419432325742\\\",\\\"patch_type\\\":1,\\\"timestamp\\\":1792579375072,\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_chunk\\\"}\",\"id\":\"1436419432325742\",\"message_request_id\":\"f408233f36668d7dd648f61b21c17987\",\"msg_type\":8,\"reply_to\":\"1436419367674493\",\"sender_id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"sender_user\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang's Migoo\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://migoo.ai/beeai/api/v1/media/download/2025/12/15/e9e12f4d.png\",\"user_type\":2,\"human\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980595\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKSTbh9Bga7HApyQcD8DUbuaYi9MMiPzTk5Rvyw2AhNhKwaoM=s96-c\",\"user_type\":1,\"relation\":1},\"relation\":0},\"seq\":1166,\"timestamp\":1792579369011},\"msg_id\":\"1436419432325742\",\"read_msg_seq\":0,\"reply_to\":\"1436419367674493\",\"timestamp\":1792579375355,\"title\":\"\",\"type\":\"stream_chunk\"}],\"chunk_count\":52,\"server_first_chunk_ms\":36,\"stream_end_at\":1792579378023,\"stream_end_payload\":{\"close_thinking\":true,\"content\":\"Choose toner by **exact printer compatibility first**—not merely by brand or appearance.\\n\\n1. **Find the printer’s full model number**  \\n   Check the front label, settings page, or existing cartridge. Printers in the same series may use different toner codes.\\n\\n2. **Match the exact cartridge code**  \\n   Confirm the code on the printer maker’s compatibility list or packaging. A cartridge that physically fits may still be rejected by its chip.\\n\\n3. **Choose standard or high yield**\\n   - **Standard yield:** lower upfront cost; suitable for occasional printing.\\n   - **High-yield/XL:** costs more initially but usually lowers cost per page; better for frequent printing.  \\n   Verify that your exact printer accepts the high-yield version.\\n\\n4. **Compare cost per page**  \\n   Use: **cartridge price ÷ stated page yield**. Page-yield figures are standardized estimates, so heavy graphics and dense pages consume toner faster.\\n\\n5. **Decide between OEM and compatible toner**\\n   - **OEM:** generally the safest choice for print consistency, firmware compatibility, and support.\\n   - **Third-party compatible:** often less expensive, but chip recognition, leakage, colour accuracy, and actual yield can vary. Look for a clear warranty and return policy.\\n\\n6. **Check whether the drum is separate**  \\n   Some printers combine toner and drum in one cartridge; others require periodic drum replacement. Don’t accidentally buy only a drum unit when you need toner.\\n\\n7. **For colour printers, verify the colour and pack contents**  \\n   Confirm whether the listing is one black cartridge, one colour, or a complete CMYK set. Avoid listings whose displayed price applies only to one colour.\\n\\n8. **Check regional and firmware restrictions**  \\n   Some cartridges are region-specific, and printer firmware updates can affect third-party chips. Confirm the cartridge’s region and supported firmware before ordering.\\n\\n**Best default:** occasional home use → standard-yield OEM; frequent office printing → compatible high-yield OEM, or a well-warranted third-party cartridge if reducing cost per page matters most.\\n\\nIf you share the printer’s exact model number and country, I can identify the correct cartridge code.\",\"conversation_type\":2,\"conversation_unread_count\":0,\"finish_reason\":\"STOP\",\"latest_msg_seq\":0,\"message\":{\"conversation_id\":\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\",\"customized_data\":\"{\\\"blocks\\\":[{\\\"extra_info\\\":{\\\"category\\\":\\\"shopping_guide\\\",\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"STOP\\\",\\\"cost_state\\\":2,\\\"billing_user_id\\\":\\\"1312453424980595\\\",\\\"sender_timezone\\\":\\\"Asia/Shanghai\\\",\\\"follow_up_query_suggestions\\\":[\\\"How to find my printer model?\\\"]},\\\"payload\\\":{\\\"content\\\":\\\"Choose toner by **exact printer compatibility first**—not merely by brand or appearance.\\\\n\\\\n1. **Find the printer’s full model number**  \\\\n   Check the front label, settings page, or existing cartridge. Printers in the same series may use different toner codes.\\\\n\\\\n2. **Match the exact cartridge code**  \\\\n   Confirm the code on the printer maker’s compatibility list or packaging. A cartridge that physically fits may still be rejected by its chip.\\\\n\\\\n3. **Choose standard or high yield**\\\\n   - **Standard yield:** lower upfront cost; suitable for occasional printing.\\\\n   - **High-yield/XL:** costs more initially but usually lowers cost per page; better for frequent printing.  \\\\n   Verify that your exact printer accepts the high-yield version.\\\\n\\\\n4. **Compare cost per page**  \\\\n   Use: **cartridge price ÷ stated page yield**. Page-yield figures are standardized estimates, so heavy graphics and dense pages consume toner faster.\\\\n\\\\n5. **Decide between OEM and compatible toner**\\\\n   - **OEM:** generally the safest choice for print consistency, firmware compatibility, and support.\\\\n   - **Third-party compatible:** often less expensive, but chip recognition, leakage, colour accuracy, and actual yield can vary. Look for a clear warranty and return policy.\\\\n\\\\n6. **Check whether the drum is separate**  \\\\n   Some printers combine toner and drum in one cartridge; others require periodic drum replacement. Don’t accidentally buy only a drum unit when you need toner.\\\\n\\\\n7. **For colour printers, verify the colour and pack contents**  \\\\n   Confirm whether the listing is one black cartridge, one colour, or a complete CMYK set. Avoid listings whose displayed price applies only to one colour.\\\\n\\\\n8. **Check regional and firmware restrictions**  \\\\n   Some cartridges are region-specific, and printer firmware updates can affect third-party chips. Confirm the cartridge’s region and supported firmware before ordering.\\\\n\\\\n**Best default:** occasional home use → standard-yield OEM; frequent office printing → compatible high-yield OEM, or a well-warranted third-party cartridge if reducing cost per page matters most.\\\\n\\\\nIf you share the printer’s exact model number and country, I can identify the correct cartridge code.\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"markdown\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\"}],\\\"conv_id\\\":\\\"7fba988b-37ea-4058-a97d-0757d1485313\\\",\\\"msg_id\\\":\\\"1436419432325742\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1792579377812}\",\"id\":\"1436419432325742\",\"message_request_id\":\"f408233f36668d7dd648f61b21c17987\",\"msg_type\":8,\"reply_to\":\"1436419367674493\",\"sender_id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"sender_user\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980596\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang's Migoo\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://migoo.ai/beeai/api/v1/media/download/2025/12/15/e9e12f4d.png\",\"user_type\":2,\"human\":{\"id\":\"1312453424980595\",\"display_name\":\"Yunzhao Wang\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKSTbh9Bga7HApyQcD8DUbuaYi9MMiPzTk5Rvyw2AhNhKwaoM=s96-c\",\"user_type\":1,\"relation\":1},\"relation\":0},\"seq\":1166,\"timestamp\":1792579369011},\"msg_id\":\"1436419432325742\",\"read_msg_seq\":0,\"reply_to\":\"1436419367674493\",\"timestamp\":1792579377928,\"title\":\"Agent\",\"type\":\"stream_end\"},\"server_stream_total_ms\":8833}]}","shopee_webUnique_ccd":"\"gVnjuZFghJIWBVD/Qzx/LQ==|mNVzSyGmfXZLwQ6aMqbWPqnC9wWgpAPgnHs8tVy/aIrCJd/ukPeemKxZgb7cZhNNkI3iQtZwXJ2ihR4RwZGO|Kdo8qvD43GXLb0QJ|08|3\"","migoo:ecom-template-preview":"split","migoo_device_startup_reported_device_id_v1":"718ac077-aa92-4a45-8e0a-ef8487b0230b","@firebase/performance/configexpire":"179285489