h to use Migoo again in the future, you will need to create a new account\",\n  \"delete_account.page_title\": \"Delete Account\",\n  \"delete_account.section_notice\": \"Important notice\",\n  \"delete_account.section_what_happens\": \"What happens when you delete your account\",\n  \"delete_account.section_when_deleted\": \"When will my data be deleted\",\n  \"delete_account.when_deleted_text\": \"Your account will be deactivated immediately upon confirmation. We will delete your personal data from our systems without undue delay, except where retention is required or permitted by applicable laws (such as for legal, security, or fraud prevention purposes).\",\n  \"desktop.auth.open_app.action\": \"Open Migoo\",\n  \"desktop.auth.open_app.description\": \"Click the button below to return to Migoo Desktop and continue with authorization\",\n  \"desktop.auth.open_app.title\": \"Open Migoo to Continue\",\n  \"desktop.browser.empty.hint\": \"Enter a URL to open a page\",\n  \"desktop.control.callback.action\": \"Open Migoo\",\n  \"desktop.control.callback.done.description\": \"You can go back to Migoo and continue.\",\n  \"desktop.control.callback.done.title\": \"Verification complete\",\n  \"desktop.control.callback.failed.description\": \"Go back to Migoo and try again.\",\n  \"desktop.control.callback.failed.title\": \"Verification failed\",\n  \"desktop.login.done.action\": \"Open Migoo App\",\n  \"desktop.login.done.description\": \"Launching the Migoo App...\",\n  \"desktop.login.done.title\": \"Login Complete\",\n  \"desktop.login.failed.action\": \"Log in again\",\n  \"desktop.login.failed.description\": \"Login failed\",\n  \"desktop.login.failed.title\": \"Login Failed\",\n  \"desktop.update.action.ok\": \"OK\",\n  \"desktop.update.action.restart\": \"Restart\",\n  \"desktop.update.check.checking\": \"Checking for updates…\",\n  \"desktop.update.check.failed.description\": \"Unable to check for updates. Please try again later.\",\n  \"desktop.update.check.fai