your email and we'll notify you when access becomes available.\",\n  \"invite.waitlist_invalid_email\": \"Please enter a valid email address\",\n  \"invite.waitlist_success_body\": \"We'll send your invite code to {email} as soon as spot opens up.\",\n  \"invite.waitlist_success_title\": \"You're on the list!\",\n  \"invite.waitlist_title\": \"Join the Waitlist\",\n  \"item.card.comparison.header.item\": \"Item\",\n  \"item.card.comparison.view.aria\": \"View {name}\",\n  \"item.card.gallery.image.alt\": \"product image\",\n  \"item.card.hero.source.buy\": \"Buy at {retailer}\",\n  \"item.card.hero.view.aria\": \"View product detail: {name}\",\n  \"item.card.image.fallback\": \"No image\",\n  \"item_card.collapse\": \"Collapse\",\n  \"item_card.more_products\": \"More Products\",\n  \"item_msg.sold_count\": \"{count} sold\",\n  \"landing.slides.canvas.brief.description\": \"Create clear, professional decks for reports, pitches, and proposals.\",\n  \"landing.slides.canvas.brief.title\": \"From brief to business presentations\",\n  \"landing.slides.canvas.edit.description\": \"Select what to change and let AI refine it.\",\n  \"landing.slides.canvas.edit.title\": \"Mark and Edit freely\",\n  \"landing.slides.canvas.subtitle\": \"Complete your presentation hassle-free, from start to finish, in one tool\",\n  \"landing.slides.canvas.title\": \"Create, Edit, and Present, All on One Canvas\",\n  \"landing.slides.closing.disclaimer\": \"AI can make mistakes. Please review important outputs.\",\n  \"landing.slides.closing.title\": \"Make the Next Deliverable Happen.\",\n  \"landing.slides.composer.placeholder\": \"Describe your presentation topic, or click \\\"+\\\" to upload files or add links\",\n  \"landing.slides.cta.create\": \"Create My Presentation\",\n  \"landing.slides.footnote.closing\": \"Create polished presentations, AI videos, designs, documents, data analysis and more with Migoo, your personal AI Team for turning ideas into ready-to-use content.\",\n  \"landing.slides.footnote.points\": \"Migoo lets you generate presentations from an idea, topic, or material you already have. Describe what you want to present, upload a file, or add a link, and let Migoo build your first draft. Then, choose from a range of the best PowerPoint templates that match your topic, audience, and goal.\\nCreate, edit, and present all on one canvas, keeping your presentation together from the first draft to the final delivery. Make changes as you go, and move from idea to a finished deck without switching tools. You don't need design skills to get a clean, professional result. Migoo's simple workflow makes it easy to get started without moving between different tools. Create polished presentations for work, business, and every idea in between.\",\n  \"landing.slides.footnote.title\": \"Power Your Ideas with Migoo, Your AI Presentation Maker\",\n  \"landing.slides.hero.description\": \"Create an editable, polished deck from a single brief — with structure, writing, and visual direction already handled.\",\n  \"landing.slides.hero.eyebrow\": \"Your AI Presentation Maker\",\n  \"landing.slides.hero.headline\": \"Best PowerPoint {highlight} for Every Style\",\n  \"landing.slides.hero.headline_highlight\": \"Templates\",\n  \"landing.slides.hero.headline_mobile\": \"Best PowerPoint {highlight} for Every Style\",\n  \"landing.slides.hero.summary\": \"Find ready-made templates for work, business, creative projects, and every idea in between\",\n  \"landing.slides.hero.title\": \"From Rough Idea to Ready to Present\",\n  \"landing.slides.nav.try_now\": \"Try Now\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.discount\": \"Enjoy 80% Off\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.explore\": \"Explore more models at surprisingly low prices\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.original_price\": \"$0.05\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.price\": \"$0.01\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.price_prefix\": \"JUST\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.subtitle\": \"Create polished presentations at a fraction of the cost\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.title\": \"Professional Slides,Just {highlight}\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.title_highlight\": \"$0.01 Each\",\n  \"landing.slides.offer.unit\": \"Per Powerpoint Slide\",\n  \"landing.slides.promo.badge\": \"Just 1¢ Per PowerPoint Slide\",\n  \"landing.slides.seo.description\": \"Find ready-made PowerPoint templates for work, business, and creative projects. Describe your topic or upload a file, and Migoo builds your first draft.\",\n  \"landing.slides.seo.title\": \"Migoo AI Presentation Maker - Best PowerPoint Templates\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step1.description\": \"Begin with an outcome-specific structure.\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step1.label\": \"Choose a template\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step1.title\": \"Pick a template that matches your goal\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step2.description\": \"Use plain language — no special prompting needed.\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step2.label\": \"Add your brief\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step2.title\": \"Describe your company, audience, and key facts\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step3.description\": \"Keep editing and sharing inside Migoo.\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step3.label\": \"Edit & export\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.step3.title\": \"Review, edit, and export your deck\",\n  \"landing.slides.steps.title\": \"A Finished Deck in Three Moves.\",\n  \"landing.slides.templates.description\": \"Each template comes with a proven narrative, editable content, and a polished visual system.\",\n  \"landing.slides.templates.empty\": \"No Content\",\n  \"landing.slides.templates.recommend_subtitle\": \"Featured works made with Migoo\",\n  \"landing.slides.templates.recommend_title\": \"Recommended for you\",\n  \"landing.slides.templates.show_less\": \"Show Less\",\n  \"landing.slides.templates.show_more\": \"Show More\",\n  \"landing.slides.templates.title\": \"Choose Your Starting Point.\",\n  \"landing.slides.templates.use_it\": \"Use it\",\n  \"landing.video.canvas.brief.description\": \"Pick a ready-made template, and turn your ideas into results.\",\n  \"landing.video.canvas.brief.title\": \"From brief to first cut\",\n  \"landing.video.canvas.edit.description\": \"Select what to change and let AI refine it.\",\n  \"landing.video.canvas.edit.title\": \"Mark and Edit freely\",\n  \"landing.video.canvas.subtitle\": \"Generate and edit your video on one platform\",\n  \"landing.video.canvas.title\": \"Create and Edit with AI, All on One Canvas\",\n  \"landing.video.composer.attachments_not_saved\": \"Your attachments couldn't be saved. Please add them again after signing in.\",\n  \"landing.video.footnote.closing\": \"Create polished presentations, AI videos, designs, documents, data analysis and more with Migoo, your personal AI Team for turning ideas into ready-to-use content.\",\n  \"landing.video.footnote.item1\": \"Create professional-looking AI videos with Migoo, and turn your ideas into results.\",\n  \"landing.video.footnote.item2\": \"From brief to first cut, browse curated templates to find a style that fits your video, whether you’re making a product promo or paid social ad, or bringing a short drama, manga-style video, or animation to life. Each template gives you a structure to build on, with the story, scenes, and pacing already in place.\",\n  \"landing.video.footnote.item3\": \"Make the video your own as you go. Mark a scene or detail you want to change, then let AI refine it while you guide the edits. Create and edit on one canvas, from the first cut to the final version. With Migoo, you can explore more creative directions with AI video generation that keeps you within budget.\",\n  \"landing.video.footnote.points\": \"Create professional-looking AI videos with Migoo, and turn your ideas into results.\\nFrom brief to first cut, browse curated templates to find a style that fits your video, whether you’re making a product promo or paid social ad, or bringing a short drama, manga-style video, or animation to life. Each template gives you a structure to build on, with the story, scenes, and pacing already in place.\\nMake the video your own as you go. Mark a scene or detail you want to change, then let AI refine it while you guide the edits. Create and edit on one canvas, from the first cut to the final version. With Migoo, you can explore more creative directions with AI video generation that keeps you within budget.\",\n  \"landing.video.footnote.title\": \"Your Best AI Videos Start with Migoo, Your AI Video Maker\",\n  \"landing.video.hero.description\": \"Create product promos, social ads, short drama, and manga-style videos \\nwith the story, scenes, and pacing already built\",\n  \"landing.video.hero.title\": \"Your Best AI Videos Start Here\",\n  \"landing.video.nav.try_now\": \"Try Now\",\n  \"landing.video.offer.discount\": \"Enjoy 50% Off\",\n  \"landing.video.offer.explore\": \"Explore more models at surprisingly low prices\",\n  \"landing.video.offer.original_price\": \"$0.134\",\n  \"landing.video.offer.price\": \"$0.067\",\n  \"landing.video.offer.price_prefix\": \"JUST\",\n  \"landing.video.offer.subtitle\": \"Bring more video ideas to life while keeping every project within budget\",\n  \"landing.video.offer.title\": \"Seedance 2.5, Now at Half the Price\",\n  \"landing.video.offer.unit\": \"Per Second\",\n  \"landing.video.promo.badge\": \"Seedance 2.5 at half price\",\n  \"landing.video.seo.description\": \"Create professional AI videos from a prompt or template — product promos, social ads, short drama and more, with the story, scenes, and pacing already built.\",\n  \"landing.video.seo.title\": \"Migoo AI Video Maker - Your Best AI Videos Start Here\",\n  \"landing.video.templates.show_less\": \"Show Less\",\n  \"landing.video.templates.show_more\": \"Show More\",\n  \"landing.video.templates.subtitle\": \"Find ready-made video templates for every story, style, and goal\",\n  \"landing.video.templates.title\": \"Discover A World Of Curated Templates\",\n  \"librar